    Getting Started

Option A: Run locally (quick):

Just open index.html in your browser.

Option B: Recommended (local server):
Some browser features behave more consistently on a local server.

VS Code → install Live Server

Right click index.html → Open with Live Server

Notes / Caveats:

Scroll reveal animation uses modern CSS (animation-timeline: view()).

If a browser doesn’t support it, the site gracefully falls back (content simply appears without the animation).

The “Google Maps API” portion is an embed (no API key required).
If you want a “true API integration,” replace the iframe with the Maps JavaScript API + key later.

Customization Tips

Theme tokens are in styles.css under :root and html[data-theme="dark"]

Replace placeholder contact info:

Phone: tel:+15555550123

Email: hello@disciplineos.example

Drop your real PDF into assets/resume.pdf to activate the Resume link.

